{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1553.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"6cfe481fd6bb386347cbaa65e2a3d12d6a03fb93d7ca0db2edabd7e64d500ea3","ja":"いざ、収録へ","zh":"奔赴收录现场","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1553.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"685945dde0a21ebc88fac71c561011847001d5fc8b7c09a8b96d5165ddd8a511","ja":"今回のお仕事は、音楽番組の収録。\n他事務所のアイドルたちとスタジオライブの予定で……","zh":"这次的工作是录制音乐节目。\n计划和其他事务所的偶像们一起进行演播室现场演出……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1553.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"9b92aa86112d935e4571eb5874119d89e63924cb4b7d6ab5fc33d45e4e2d1ee5","ja":"あれっ？　春香さん、お手紙読んでるの？","zh":"哎？春香，你在看信吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1553.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"02488f7a467384ded7623d6456a307bec8cb44dbb06be21644999bb78aa757bb","ja":"うん、天体公演の後にもらったファンレター。\n本番前に、もう一度読み直しておきたくて。","zh":"嗯，是天体公演后收到的粉丝信。\n我想在正式演出前，再重读一遍。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1553.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"55abe0166a3a2a85b9f1bf0e004e8c7e65aca88293cd05862d00bf984f672982","ja":"そっか～。ファンレターって、\nもらうとすっごくうれしいよね！","zh":"这样啊～。收到粉丝来信，\n真的会超级开心呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1553.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"be9678b2619ed502d54cbf15ed2dc822c1b0519f72fb5ba84d584f39a010ef40","ja":"うん！　この間までのロングラン公演が、\nたくさんの人が見守ってくれたんだって、実感できて。","zh":"嗯！前阵子长期公演的时候，\n让我切实感受到了有很多人在守护着我们。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1553.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"b8d91f5795519c0a22a1bd6534b158ca693bffdb9d0a919817bd04fb85855d11","ja":"だから今日は、観覧のお客さんやテレビを見てくれる\nみんなに、最高のステージを見せようね！","zh":"所以今天，一定要给现场的观众\n以及收看电视的大家，展现最棒的舞台哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1553.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"a1bcd06d7f1572aa47999ecf85e5f2c049aaac681de3ccb0bff93004e600a49a","ja":"うん！　「応援してくれてありがとう、これからも\nよろしくね」って気持ちを、いっぱい伝えるね！","zh":"嗯！我会把“谢谢你们一直以来的支持，今后也\n请多多关照”的心情，充分传达给大家的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1553.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"96127dd94984afedf8590a809127fc198e4b1482c1ec95b8adf5487f11151b9e","ja":"ふたりともやる気満々ね～。こんなに燃えてたら、\n共演するアイドルの子たちが気おされちゃうかもね。","zh":"两个人都是干劲十足呢～。这么斗志高昂的话，\n一起共演的偶像孩子们说不定会被震慑住呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1553.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"c60608afbdf0d90e2f72a913d3ee56d713f1d13a9ce0db4dd8110a577271284b","ja":"それは大丈夫だと思います！　むしろみなさん、\nとっても喜んで、一緒に燃えてくださるかとっ！","zh":"我觉得那方面没问题的！不如说大家\n肯定会非常开心，和我们一起燃起来的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1553.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"449fd4fcc7b8ed3abf36a0266e4da8c223297bc5f7624f3a588246f50ef2e9b9","ja":"すごくハッキリ言い切ってるけど、\n何か根拠でもあるの？","zh":"你说得这么斩钉截铁，\n是有什么根据吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1553.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"ed7e94a540f07509758f2d0586684c790d9da162221330d086db46dac51709f2","ja":"はいっ！　実は今回の出演者のみなさん、劇場の公演を\n見にいらしてたことがある方たちなんですよ！","zh":"是的！其实这次的演出人员，全都是\n曾经来看过剧场公演的各位呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1553.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"3309419d9e547f52ade2ab0854e3362f4f4b0f194e783f8d10b45cc096a8a1df","ja":"ありさがSNSでくまなくチェックしていたので、\n間違いありませんっ！！","zh":"亚利沙在社交平台上仔仔细细查过了，\n绝对不会有错的！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1553.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"9fe7955b750e262611217cc7dac95e252c8f70e25cb55d8a9a8fa29b4a62e9b6","ja":"ええっ、そうなの！？\nすごい偶然だね！","zh":"诶诶，是这样吗！？\n这也太巧了吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1553.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"eafa89d37ad1720e4e8be2267d82bb8dc8badf4aaa913717290595b0999e00f3","ja":"だからきっと、ありさたちが燃えていたら、\n喜んでくれるハズです！","zh":"所以只要亚利沙他们燃起来的话，\n就肯定会很高兴的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1553.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"6e607d48e512cd097e3f4495d38f65b76de8cf5879a492b28d54ddbb068d43e4","ja":"ふふ、なら遠慮なくやらないとね♪　……っと、\nもうこんな時間。そろそろスタジオに向かいましょ！","zh":"呵呵，那可就不能客气了呢♪……哎呀，\n都这个时间了。差不多该去练习室了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1553.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"88bf99c9acaecad82d150bc99e868a1961e1e7735b6ecb4c252f24f5b2c305bb","ja":"おはようございます、\n今日はよろしくお願いしま……あれっ？","zh":"早上好，\n今天请多指教……咦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1553.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"d716950f1524a6b4cf57d24e5b45cba848ad788fc086b2080cbd6ac7792c2687","ja":"他の出演者さんも、お客さんもいない……？","zh":"其他参演者和观众都不在……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
